Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: cham3-base
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: cham3 M0 development skeleton (no functionality)
 This package is an M0 development skeleton for the cham3 project. It
 installs only documentation under /usr/share/doc/cham3-base. It installs
 no services, no security policy, no enforcement components and no system
 configuration. It exists only to validate Debian packaging and live image
 integration.
 .
 Installing this package does not make a system a cham3 system and does not
 provide application isolation, permission contracts or network controls.
